      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The Kestria Revenue Service processed 92 per cent of complete sales tax refund claims within 15 working days during September. This compares with 86 per cent in August. September payments totalled KRN 18.4 million across 1,760 claims, including claims from manufacturers, wholesalers and building contractors."
        },
