          "text": "The Kestria Revenue Service received 12,716 corporate tax returns by the 30 September deadline from companies with accounting years ending on 31 March 2026. This represents 93.5 per cent of the 13,600 returns expected. The comparable filing rate for the previous year was 91.8 per cent."
        },
