    {
      "date": "2026-10-06",
      "title": "Ostara businesses offered working capital review appointments this month",
      "author": "Tomas Arlen",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Harrow & Finch Bank is offering 30 working capital review appointments for mid-sized businesses at its Ostara branch between 12 and 30 October. The sessions are intended for companies preparing for seasonal changes in stock purchases, customer payments or supplier bills."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Each appointment lasts up to an hour and carries no charge. Businesses should bring a thirteen-week cash-flow forecast, a list of unpaid customer invoices and details of existing borrowing. A relationship manager will discuss the timing of expected receipts and payments and identify any information needed for a lending application."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Attendance does not require a company to move its banking arrangements. Any subsequent request for an overdraft or loan will be assessed separately, with rates and fees explained before acceptance. Telephone appointments are available for businesses outside Ostara that cannot attend the branch during the scheduled period."
